RISK ANALYSIS & MITIGATION







Primary Risk: Year 1 Cash Flow



Issue: Required debt service ($155,555/month) exceeds optimal cash allocation for Year 1



Mitigation Strategies:



1. Extended Payment Terms: 48-month schedule reduces to $116,667/month

2. Revenue Acceleration: Focus on larger enterprise deals in Q2-Q4

3. Payment Timing: Begin payments Month 24 instead of Month 19

4. Working Capital Line: $2M credit facility for payment smoothing



Secondary Risk: Market Adoption



Issue: Customer acquisition delays could impact revenue timing



Mitigation:

• Beta customer pre-commitments secured

• Regulatory authority partnerships established  

• Multi-year contracts with upfront payments

• Conservative revenue projections provide buffer







