RECOMMENDED FINANCING STRUCTURE







Hybrid Model: Performance-Based Payments



Months 19-30 (Year 2):

• $100,000/month when monthly revenue >$500K

• $125,000/month when monthly revenue >$750K

• $150,000/month when monthly revenue >$1M



Months 31-42 (Year 3):

• $175,000/month (revenue easily supports by this phase)



Months 43-54 (Year 4):

• $200,000/month (final payment phase)



Total Payments: $5,600,000 over 36 months, aligned with revenue growth



This structure provides:

• Payment flexibility during initial growth phase

• Accelerated payments as revenue scales

• Complete loan satisfaction within original timeframe

• Risk mitigation for both investor and company







